@TUTORIAL_ENTRY_INFO_401
TUTORIAL_ENTRY_NAME '= "About Lethal Combat"
TUTORIAL_ENTRY_TYPE '= "NAS Features"
TUTORIAL_ENTRY_SHOW = 1

@TUTORIAL_ENTRY_401
CALL DQPRINT("「Lethal combat is exactly as it sounds.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「Unlike danmaku battles, there's no rules, no restraints, not governors.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「It's simply you, your weapon, your allies, and your enemies.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「Any wounds taken will stay unlike normal danmaku, where it's all regenerated after battle.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「You can tend these wounds, but only time will heal wounds taken in battle.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「Keep in mind that if you lose a vital limb such as a head, torso, heart, or a liver, you WILL die.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「There's also three different skills which can be used in battle: Danmaku, Shooting and Melee.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「『Danmaku』 is well, your danmaku skill. Keep in mind you need to know the Danmaku Youjutsu to be able to use Danmaku.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「『Shooting』 skill determines your accuracy with firearms, and is very important if you want to land hits on vital organs.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「『Melee』 determines your melee accuracy, as well as general damage dealt due to arm strength.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「Your chance to dodge also increases with the level of your respective combat skill.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「『Dodge』 rolls independently of accuracy. You may be able to land a hit at a target, but if the target dodges the bullet, then you still miss.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「『Armor』 also plays a very important part of combat.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「Armor has armor strength, which affects what bullets it can stop, and armor durability, which is how many shots it can take.」", FLAG:594)		
CALL DQPRINT("「You need armor that can last and be able to soak up a few shots of whatever's being used.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「Most youkai have natural, unbreakable armor that can stop pistol rounds. You'll need a rifle to take on those.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「Don't bother with pistols. They're generally used only for Human Vs. Human engagements.」", FLAG:594)
CALL DQPRINT("「Armor can also break catastrophically, leaving you exposed and can lead you to getting killed.」", FLAG:594)
